  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Number of formulas in cube shaped crystals $=\\frac{1.0}{58.5} \\times 6.02 \\times 10^{23}$ since in $\\mathrm{NaCl}$ type of structure 4 formula units form a cell\n$\\therefore$ unit cells $=\\frac{1.0 \\times 6.02 \\times 10^{23}}{58.5 \\times 4}=2.57 \\times 10^{21}$ unit cells.",
    "image": null
  },
